# 18. Algorithm Complexity Summary

| Algorithm | Graph Type | Time | Space |
|---|---|---:|---:|
| BFS | Unweighted or equal weights | `O(V + E)` | `O(V + E)` |
| Multi-Source BFS | Multiple equal-cost sources | `O(V + E)` | `O(V + E)` |
| 0-1 BFS | Weights only 0 and 1 | `O(V + E)` | `O(V + E)` |
| Dijkstra | Non-negative weights | `O((V + E) log V)` | `O(V + E)` |
| Bellman-Ford | Negative weights | `O(V × E)` | `O(V)` |
| DAG Shortest Path | Weighted DAG | `O(V + E)` | `O(V + E)` |
| Floyd-Warshall | All-pairs shortest path | `O(V³)` | `O(V²)` |

